@startuml autonomous-culture-governance
title Autonomous Culture / Governance Boundary ; per ADR-ES-024 section 12

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Autonomous Culture" as AuCult

class "Objectives" as Obj
class "Authority" as Auth
class "Policy" as Pol
class "Constraints" as Con
class "Accountability" as Acct
class "Governance" as Gov
class "Escalation" as Esc
class "Observation" as Obs

AuCult --> Obj : aligned-with
AuCult --> Auth : operates-within
AuCult --> Pol : governed-by
AuCult --> Con : constrained-by
AuCult --> Acct : accountable-under
AuCult --> Gov : operates-under
AuCult --> Esc : escalates-to
AuCult --> Obs : observation-under

note bottom of AuCult
  Cultural autonomy is bounded by 8 governance fences.
  Per ADR-ES-024 section 12.
end note

@enduml
